## WORKER DO-NOT-DISPATCH

You own one assigned unit. Workers never dispatch sub-agents or coordinate
other units. Run the unit's focused verification yourself and return its
proof. Review the assignment and proof before every submission.

## WORKER-SCOPED VERIFICATION

Run the focused `Verify` command from each assigned step and cite its exit
code. The full repository-wide gate (`make verify`) is the main session's
job; do not run it from inside this worker.
